{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24069","headline":"三适赠道友 · 白居易","name":"三适赠道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"褐绫袍厚暖，卧盖行坐披。\n紫毡履宽稳，蹇步颇相宜。\n足适已忘履，身适已忘衣。\n况我心又适，兼忘是与非。\n三适今爲一，怡怡复熙熙。\n禅那不动处，混沌未凿时。\n此固不可说，爲君强言之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}